# Names to show in the contributor list of the release announcement (see contributors.py).
# Add an entry only when:
#  1. a contributor asks to be shown with another name,
#  2. credits are known to be the same person but share no email, name or GitHub login,
#     so they cannot be matched automatically, or
#  3. a wrong email in some commit merges two people. Map that name and email to the right
#     email, e.g. "Right Name <right@email> Right Name <wrong@email>".
# Note why each entry was added, so that it can be checked later.
#
# The format is the one of git mailmap (see https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap), but this
# file is only used by contributors.py and does not change how git shows names elsewhere.

# 1. Asked for in https://github.com/apache/kafka-site/pull/928
Gabriella Fu <100360154+gabriellefu@users.noreply.github.com>
Jiayao Sun <jiayao.s@outlook.com>

# 2. The GitHub account imavishek also commits as Avishek Das <avishek.akd@gmail.com>
Avishek Das <imavishek@users.noreply.github.com>
